STEPS:

Mecanum Setup
 1.select Mecanum Procedure
 2.Enter the HardwareMap name
 3.Motor Direction Identification
 Test:
    Select Tests Procedure and select Driving
    Use your gamepad to drive the robot around

Pinpoint Setup
 #### pinpoint is plugged into an I2C port other than port 0 ####
 1.Select Pinpoint Procedure
 2.Enter the HardwareMap name
 3.Forward Direction Identification ## push forward
 4.Strafe Direction Identification ## push to the left
 5.Offsets Identification ## rotate 180 degrees
 6.Applying the Results in Constants
 Test:
    Select Tests Procedure and select Localization
    should see robot starts at (0, 0)
    Check that moving forward increases x and strafing left increases y

Foresight Setup
 1.Select Foresight Procedure
 2.Forward Velocity Identification ## run forward for the specified distance
 3.Strafe Velocity Identification ## run left for the specified distance
 4.Forward Deceleration Identification ## run forward until it reaches the specified velocity
 5.Strafe Deceleration Identification ## run left until it reaches the specified velocity
 6.Heading Braking Identification ##  spinning back and forth
 7.Heading Tuner ##  spinning the robot in a direction
 8.Forward Braking Identification ## run forward for a specified distance
 9.Strafe Braking Identification ## run left for a specified distance
 10.Forward Translational Tuner ## run forward about 12-24 inches
 11.Strafe Translational Tuner ## run left about 12-24 inches
 12.Applying the Results in Constants
 Test:
    Select Tests Procedure
    Localization Test
    Driving Test
    Pose Test
    Hold Test
    Line Test
    Curved Test
    Interpolation Test

